WEBVTT

00:02:57.051 --> 00:03:00.133
to home system kits
that can charge phones,

00:03:00.157 --> 00:03:02.030
power a television

00:03:02.054 --> 00:03:03.537
or run a fan.

00:03:03.561 --> 00:03:04.970
I want to be clear:

00:03:04.994 --> 00:03:07.635
off-grid solar is a big deal in Africa.

00:03:07.659 --> 00:03:09.544
I have worked in the sector for years,

00:03:09.568 --> 00:03:12.978
and these products are enabling us
to extend basic energy services

00:03:13.002 --> 00:03:14.738
to some of the world's poorest,

00:03:14.762 --> 00:03:16.651
raising their quality of life.

00:03:16.675 --> 00:03:19.918
This is a very good
and a very important thing.

00:03:19.942 --> 00:03:24.578
However, off-grid solar will not solve
energy poverty in Africa,

00:03:24.602 --> 00:03:25.797
and for that matter,

00:03:25.821 --> 00:03:28.960
neither will a top-down effort
to connect every unserved household

00:03:28.984 --> 00:03:30.234
to the grid.